# HubSpot pre-reset backup — REAL CUSTOMER PII. Never enters git (VLP no-customer-PII rule).
adapters/hubspot/backup/

# Klaritie bank ingest — CLIENT FINANCIAL DATA. The transaction CSV and anything
# derived from it that contains individual rows never enters git.
data/
*.csv
# EXCEPT the mirror export. THE RULE ABOVE IS ABOUT CLIENT FINANCIAL DATA AND THIS EXCEPTION
# does not weaken it: cf-mirror-export.csv is a list of HubSpot PROPERTY DEFINITIONS — internal
# name, label, type, option labels and values, and this repo's binding for each. It carries no
# property VALUES, no contact records, no names, no tax identification numbers and nothing
# belonging to a real person; the contact object is never queried to build it, only
# /crm/v3/properties/contacts, which returns schema. The exception is ONE exact path, not a
# pattern, so no other CSV can slip through it. Prompt 59-A item I requires this tabular
# rendering committed beside the JSON, for the case where ClickUp Brain 2 takes tabular input
# better than prose; it is generated from cf-mirror-export.json and re-derived and compared by
# adapters/hubspot/check-cf-mirror-export.mjs on every sweep.
!adapters/hubspot/cf-mirror-export.csv
scripts/.klaritie-digits-state.json
scripts/klaritie-digits-batches/
# Dry-run report: derived from the transaction CSV and prints individual rows
# (dates, amounts, check numbers, counterparties, a client street address).
reports/

# PDF engine scratch — negative-test harnesses, before/after regression baselines, ad-hoc
# probes. Reproducible from the committed tools; never a source of truth.
adapters/pdf/tmp/
